<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>flood extent 2020-03-30 — vetted by Martin 2026-09-15</name>
<description>Dark bodies (luminance 27 below the frame median) on four nadir Google Earth captures of the 30/3/2020 imagery, registered on data/geo/georef_random.kml, inside data/geo/warren.kml, west of the mosaic seam (the tile east of it is 11/9/2019 and was excluded), then vetted in Google Earth: every body under 200 m2 unticked wholesale (Martin: mainly shadows), 74 of the 180 larger bodies deleted, 34 drawn by hand.</description>
<Style id="w"><LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><fill>0</fill></PolyStyle></Style>
